        ('90020016-0000-4000-8000-000000000008', 'If an equilateral triangle has a perimeter of 60 cm, its area using Heron''s formula is:', '{"A":"100√3 cm²","B":"150√3 cm²","C":"200√3 cm²","D":"300 cm²"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'MCQ', 'Mathematics', 'Heron''s Formula', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Side a = 60 / 3 = 20 cm. Area of equilateral triangle = (√3 / 4) * a² = (√3 / 4) * 400 = 100√3 cm².', 'MEDIUM', true),
