        ('9002002b-0000-4000-8000-000000000006', 'If the radius of a sphere is doubled, its surface area becomes:', '{"A":"2 times","B":"4 times","C":"8 times","D":"16 times"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'MCQ', 'Mathematics', 'Surface Areas and Volumes', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Surface area S = 4πr². When r'' = 2r, S'' = 4π(2r)² = 4 * (4πr²) = 4S.', 'MEDIUM', true),
